   "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Valheim》是一款可供 1 至 10 人合作探索的生存遊戲。玩家將踏入受北歐神話啟發、隨機生成的世界，打造強大的武器、建造宏偉的殿堂，並擊敗強敵，向奧丁證明自己的價值！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/6df985372c935ca0551c0bda004dcffa.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/6df985372c935ca0551c0bda004dcffa.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索沉浸感十足的隨機生成世界。每個生物域都有獨特環境、稀有資源與危險敵人。化身維京人，獨自一人或與最多九名好友揚帆遠航，尋找未知的大地！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/8960756a84ec12e69d2eddc685e51202.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/8960756a84ec12e69d2eddc685e51202.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >第十世界已遭充滿憎恨的力量腐化，化為各地強大的首領「被遺棄者」。磨練斧、劍與弓的戰鬥技巧，打造最精良的裝備做好準備。唯有擊敗這些被遺棄者，你才能繼續前進，並向眾神之父證明自己。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/5c8d1008b52f7c96a574131a357c5f71.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/5c8d1008b52f7c96a574131a357c5f71.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/5c8d1008b52f7c96a574131a357c5f71.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/6d9d97a4f43b3cedde6cce3bd029cceb.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/6d9d97a4f43b3cedde6cce3bd029cceb.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建造維京長屋與基地，在前方重重危險中暫得喘息之處。無論是想打造簡陋的小屋、完整的村莊，還是山腰上的堡壘，防禦與結構穩固性都至關重要；當然，也別忘了好好裝飾一番，讓舒適度達到最佳狀態！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/686e974fc2c644b71aa70bb277fc4227.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/686e974fc2c644b71aa70bb277fc4227.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/686e974fc2c644b71aa70bb277fc4227.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/733e7feb95b00aeb435b4a8c29be1f5d.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/733e7feb95b00aeb435b4a8c29be1f5d.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >隨著你發現新的材料，你也能學會新的製作、建造與烹飪配方，滿足維京人生存所需的一切！食物系統重視獎勵而非懲罰，會依照你吃下的食物賦予各種加成與效果，並與戰鬥系統直接相連。生命值與耐力，往往就是生死之間的關鍵差異。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>社群翻譯語言</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >除了官方支援的語言之外，《Valheim》也提供多種社群翻譯語言。顧名思義，這些翻譯皆由粉絲與社群成員完成，且翻譯工作通常仍在持續進行。因此，我們無法保證任何特定翻譯的品質或完整性。</p>",
   "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Valheim》是一款可供 1 至 10 人合作探索的生存遊戲。玩家將踏入受北歐神話啟發、隨機生成的世界，打造強大的武器、建造宏偉的殿堂，並擊敗強敵，向奧丁證明自己的價值！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/fde7609cce1c42ed185ba1a000a4ae59.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/6df985372c935ca0551c0bda004dcffa.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/6df985372c935ca0551c0bda004dcffa.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索沉浸感十足的隨機生成世界。每個生物域都有獨特環境、稀有資源與危險敵人。化身維京人，獨自一人或與最多九名好友揚帆遠航，尋找未知的大地！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/197ad3ead350b82e6feddf03ad690c90.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/8960756a84ec12e69d2eddc685e51202.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/8960756a84ec12e69d2eddc685e51202.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >第十世界已遭充滿憎恨的力量腐化，化為各地強大的首領「被遺棄者」。磨練斧、劍與弓的戰鬥技巧，打造最精良的裝備做好準備。唯有擊敗這些被遺棄者，你才能繼續前進，並向眾神之父證明自己。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/5c8d1008b52f7c96a574131a357c5f71.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/5c8d1008b52f7c96a574131a357c5f71.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/5c8d1008b52f7c96a574131a357c5f71.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/6d9d97a4f43b3cedde6cce3bd029cceb.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/6d9d97a4f43b3cedde6cce3bd029cceb.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建造維京長屋與基地，在前方重重危險中暫得喘息之處。無論是想打造簡陋的小屋、完整的村莊，還是山腰上的堡壘，防禦與結構穩固性都至關重要；當然，也別忘了好好裝飾一番，讓舒適度達到最佳狀態！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/686e974fc2c644b71aa70bb277fc4227.poster.avif?t=1791544831\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/686e974fc2c644b71aa70bb277fc4227.webm?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/686e974fc2c644b71aa70bb277fc4227.mp4?t=1791544831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras/733e7feb95b00aeb435b4a8c29be1f5d.avif?t=1791544831\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892970/extras_big/733e7feb95b00aeb435b4a8c29be1f5d.avif?t=1791544831 width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >隨著你發現新的材料，你也能學會新的製作、建造與烹飪配方，滿足維京人生存所需的一切！食物系統重視獎勵而非懲罰，會依照你吃下的食物賦予各種加成與效果，並與戰鬥系統直接相連。生命值與耐力，往往就是生死之間的關鍵差異。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>社群翻譯語言</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >除了官方支援的語言之外，《Valheim》也提供多種社群翻譯語言。顧名思義，這些翻譯皆由粉絲與社群成員完成，且翻譯工作通常仍在持續進行。因此，我們無法保證任何特定翻譯的品質或完整性。</p>",
